%% Sequence diagram — authenticated user requests a recommendation (UC-06, UC-07, UC-08)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend (browser)
    participant A as Express API
    participant V as Validation
    participant E as Recommendation engine
    participant D as SQLite DB

    U->>F: Fill profile, choose goal & activity
    F->>A: PUT /api/profile (Bearer JWT)
    A->>V: validateProfile(body)
    alt invalid data
        V-->>A: errors[]
        A-->>F: 400 Validation failed + details
        F-->>U: Show error message
    else valid
        A->>D: UPDATE users
        A-->>F: 200 updated profile
        F->>A: POST /api/recommendations (Bearer JWT)
        A->>D: SELECT profile
        A->>E: generateRecommendation(profile)
        E-->>A: BMR, TDEE, calories, macros, workout
        A->>D: INSERT recommendations + workout_items (transaction)
        A-->>F: 201 recommendation JSON
        F-->>U: Display calories, macros, workout plan
    end
